<title>USA: Air Express in joint venture in S. Korea.</title>
<headline>Air Express in joint venture in S. Korea.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Conn. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Express International Corp said it has established a joint venture in Korea through the acquisition of 50 percent of the stock of its agent in South Korea, Korea Air Freight Ltd.</p>
<p>The joint venture company is to be renamed AEI Korea Ltd. Korea Air Freight President and principal shareholder Y.T. Lee is to be president of the new enterprise.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Korea Air Freight has served as AEI's airfreight agent in South Korea for the past 20 years.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
